post_install() {
cat <<EOF
=================================================
WireGuard Tray installed successfully!

Quick setup:

    Setup sudoers for passwordless operation:
    sudo wireguard-tray --sudo-setup

    Run the application:
    wireguard-tray

    Enable autostart:
    wireguard-tray --autostart

    Disable autostart:
    wireguard-tray --disable-autostart

Additional commands:
wireguard-tray --help           # Show all available commands
wireguard-tray --up wg0 wg1    # Connect to interface(s)
wireguard-tray --down wg0 wg1  # Disconnect from interface(s)

Important: Place WireGuard configuration files in /etc/wireguard/
(e.g., wg0.conf, wg-dev.conf, wg-prod.conf)
Avoid names that conflict with ip-link keywords (e.g., "dev", "type").

=================================================
EOF
}
